105
00:06:35,653 --> 00:06:40,568
He does , at the same time , get it in place , because he is also a very good lawyer .

106
00:06:41,453 --> 00:06:46,527
He 's able to , as you see , he starts very nice and then he gets progressively tougher

107
00:06:46,613 --> 00:06:49,650
