They partied . They have a great sexual relationship .

146
00:09:24,893 --> 00:09:29,045
You just have the sense that these two people have a lot of heat between them .

147
00:09:29,133 --> 00:09:31,408
But they 're young and they 've just started

148
00:09:31,493 --> 00:09:34,690
