149
00:09:35,053 --> 00:09:39,126
You know , this bar scene that we have , again , includes the lawyer .

150
00:09:40,013 --> 00:09:41,924
And you see Neal Jones .

151
00:09:42,053 --> 00:09:46,171
Basically , again , he 's the guy , he 's the devil-in-my-ear character .

152
00:09:46,733 --> 00:09:49,406
He is the one who knows what Keanu did .

153
00:09:50,573 --> 00:09:53,929
He knows , you know , in the bathroom , that he 's gonna lose

154
00:09:54,013 --> 00:09:57,801
