176
00:11:29,333 --> 00:11:33,326
The next scene that you 're about to see hot cut to Kevin 's roots :

177
00:11:34,533 --> 00:11:37,650
A Southern church , and this congregation is real .

178
00:11:39,293 --> 00:11:42,842
Judith Ivey , who is being introduced here as Kevin 's mother .

179
00:11:42,933 --> 00:11:45,322
You know Kevin was raised in this church , he 's coming

180
00:11:45,413 --> 00:11:49,565
and taking a look back at his past , was totally fundamentalist

181
00:11:49,733 --> 00:11:52,725
and deeply , deeply rooted in Jesus and God .

182
00:11:54,413 --> 00:11:56,131
Judith Ivey is part of this group .

183
00:11:56,213 --> 00:12:00,650
I had to spend a lot of effort convincing Pastor Lovell and his church

184
