188
00:12:16,973 --> 00:12:21,205
But they were fabulous , and they really got the spirit of God in them .

189
00:12:21,293 --> 00:12:24,968
And I thought it was important to see that Judith Ivey is a believer .

190
00:12:25,053 --> 00:12:27,692
She is one with her God , she loves Him .

191
00:12:28,253 --> 00:12:31,928
And , you know , she 's a formidable presence for good in this film .

192
00:12:32,013 --> 00:12:34,971
At the same time , she 's a tough mother , and you can see that

193
00:12:35,053 --> 00:12:37,965
she has raised him in a certain way and she doesn 't particularly approve

194
00:12:38,053 --> 00:12:42,729
of what he 's done with his life . He 's a lawyer , and you establish his wife

195
00:12:42,813 --> 00:12:47,682
over at the car , Mary Ann , who obviously is a party girl , a liver , and not ...

196
00:12:49,493 --> 00:12:53,008
Neither one of them are in church this morning , and Mother is not that happy .

197
00:12:53,093 --> 00:12:57,450
This sequence is important to understand that Kevin Lomax understands scripture .

198
00:12:57,533 --> 00:13:00,923
He may have made a choice at this point to stay outside the church .

199
00:13:01,013 --> 00:13:03,049
If you notice , he 's half in , half out of the light .

200
00:13:03,133 --> 00:13:06,728
Tony Gilroy wrote this in the script . Kevin Lomax stands outside the congregation .

201
00:13:06,813 --> 00:13:11,011
He 's half in , half out of the light . He is part of it and at the same time

202
00:13:11,093 --> 00:13:12,572
