203
00:13:12,653 --> 00:13:15,963
There 's a dichotomy in him , which you 'll discover later .

204
00:13:16,053 --> 00:13:19,568
But in this instance , when his mother calls up and says :

205
00:13:19,773 --> 00:13:23,561
" Quote the Bible to me and mention scripture , " he can quote it back to her .

206
00:13:23,653 --> 00:13:25,405
He knows what he 's talking about .

207
00:13:25,493 --> 00:13:28,803
He was in that church and a devout member at one point .

208
00:13:28,893 --> 00:13:32,329
Now you get a sense of Mary Ann . She is a good person .

209
00:13:34,253 --> 00:13:36,483
She 's trying to help this character .

210
00:13:36,573 --> 00:13:39,246
She doesn 't want to get the company to repossess her car .

211
00:13:39,333 --> 00:13:41,244
But she 's tough , and she 's a businesswoman .

212
00:13:41,333 --> 00:13:45,087
You also have a sense , right here , of the fun that these two people have .

213
00:13:45,173 --> 00:13:48,563
Keanu , you know , biting off her earring and handing it back to her

214
00:13:48,653 --> 00:13:53,124
that was totally spontaneous . He came in , did that . It was quite wonderful .

215
00:13:53,213 --> 00:13:57,206
Now you have a sense of the married couple . They 've got Mother-in-law

216
00:13:57,293 --> 00:13:58,885
and Mary Ann 's no dummy

217
00:13:58,973 --> 00:14:02,966
