1769
01:49:40,975 --> 01:49:45,412
And now these two people have to do a very difficult and emotional scene .

1770
01:49:46,895 --> 01:49:49,932
Now , they 're both drained in a way they would be drained in this scene .

1771
01:49:50,015 --> 01:49:52,654
You know , you work with what you have .

1772
01:49:53,015 --> 01:49:56,007
But , it is again , another culminating scene

1773
01:49:58,455 --> 01:50:01,367
an expository scene that takes us out at the end .

1774
01:50:01,935 --> 01:50:05,291
That you discover these revelations and it happens like an avalanche at the end

1775
01:50:05,375 --> 01:50:08,526
