1805
01:52:10,495 --> 01:52:15,091
And we shot this at 7 : 30 in the morning on a Sunday morning , cleared six blocks .

1806
01:52:15,175 --> 01:52:19,532
So most of what you see is real , and the last five or six blocks we digitally erased .

1807
01:52:19,615 --> 01:52:24,245
That lets you know , it serves notice , you are no longer in a realistic movie .

1808
01:52:24,335 --> 01:52:26,291
The next ... That is surreal .

1809
01:52:26,375 --> 01:52:28,935
