1813
01:52:36,695 --> 01:52:40,165
He 's now going to confront us with our own hypocrisies .

1814
01:52:40,735 --> 01:52:43,374
Us , with Kevin Lomax as our surrogate .

1815
01:52:45,055 --> 01:52:47,933
And he 's now not talking as John Milton the lawyer .

1816
01:52:48,015 --> 01:52:50,654
He 's talking as John Milton the devil .

1817
01:52:51,255 --> 01:52:56,283
In this scene , which is , I would effectively say this movie is two hours of setup

1818
01:52:56,615 --> 01:52:58,890
