1819
01:52:59,415 --> 01:53:03,044
This is a very bold scene . It 's a long scene . It 's a very theatrical scene .

1820
01:53:03,135 --> 01:53:07,208
It 's a very funny scene , but I 'm deadly serious about what it said .

1821
01:53:07,295 --> 01:53:11,527
And only with an actor like Al Pacino , only with an actor who must

1822
01:53:11,735 --> 01:53:14,932
go to the emotional truth of whatever he plays .

1823
01:53:15,095 --> 01:53:18,053
And what is the emotional truth of the devil ? It 's evil .

