1847
01:54:38,735 --> 01:54:41,966
He 's confronted with something he can 't imagine . Satan .

1848
01:54:42,055 --> 01:54:44,523
But we used humor here . " Call me dad . "

1849
01:54:45,015 --> 01:54:47,927
You know , the whole concept , that 's , again , Tony Gilroy .

1850
01:54:48,015 --> 01:54:51,894
It 's the idea , in this instance , you can 't have a scene that lasts this long

1851
01:54:51,975 --> 01:54:56,366
