1875
01:56:31,135 --> 01:56:35,253
I mean , I love the argument . And this is what we were trying to do .

1876
01:56:35,335 --> 01:56:39,328
I give a lot of credit to my collaborative partner , Tony Gilroy , on this project

1877
01:56:39,415 --> 01:56:43,931
because this piece was a script that existed with a lot of special effects

1878
01:56:44,015 --> 01:56:46,575
