He starts picking him up . He starts trying to say :

1906
01:58:29,095 --> 01:58:32,849
" Hey , you know , think of it in a positive way . You have to think of yourself .

1907
01:58:32,935 --> 01:58:36,644
" She wasn 't up to you . Here 's a woman who is . She 's fantastic .

1908
01:58:36,735 --> 01:58:39,807
" She happens to be your sister , but so what ? She 's beautiful .

1909
01:58:39,895 --> 01:58:44,571
" She 's smart . She 's intelligent . You know , there 's something more for you . "

1910
01:58:44,935 --> 01:58:49,611
And I think at this point , when confronted with the fact that he knows it 's the devil

1911
01:58:49,695 --> 01:58:52,493
and now what Milton is gonna do , is talk about ...

1912
01:58:52,575 --> 01:58:55,328
You know , remember , Keanu is half and half . He 's half Judy Ivey .

1913
01:58:55,415 --> 01:58:58,612
He 's half Al Pacino . He 's half Alice Lomax . He 's half John Milton .

1914
01:58:58,695 --> 01:59:02,973
He 's half God and half the devil , and this is relating to a lot of us .

1915
01:59:03,135 --> 01:59:05,888
We all have our good side , our bad side .

1916
01:59:06,215 --> 01:59:10,447
In this particular instance , this next sequence is , I think , really interesting

1917
